  "Q00418_PathOfTheArtisan/31956-01.html": {
   "file": "Q00418_PathOfTheArtisan/31956-01.html",
   "quest": 418,
   "text": "Warehouse Keeper Rydel: What brings you here? You aren't here to apply to be a Warehouse Keeper, are you?",
   "header": "Warehouse Keeper Rydel",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; memo 201; !(qs.isCreated() || qs.isCompleted())"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"I've got good news you've been waiting for. I'll take the reward now.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00418_PathOfTheArtisan 31956-02.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00418_PathOfTheArtisan",
     "event": "31956-02.html",
     "quest": 418,
     "to": "Q00418_PathOfTheArtisan/31956-02.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00418_PathOfTheArtisan/31956-02.html": {
   "file": "Q00418_PathOfTheArtisan/31956-02.html",
   "quest": 418,
   "text": "Warehouse Keeper Rydie: Oh, you're the one who is taking the Path to an Artisan! What a surprise! I haven't seen anyone taking the Path to an Artisan in a long time! Let me see, the good news... Means you're qualified to be an Artisan!",
   "header": "Warehouse Keeper Rydie",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Can you tell me more?\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00418_PathOfTheArtisan 31956-03.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00418_PathOfTheArtisan",
     "event": "31956-03.html",
     "quest": 418,
     "to": "Q00418_PathOfTheArtisan/31956-03.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00418_PathOfTheArtisan/31956-03.html": {
   "file": "Q00418_PathOfTheArtisan/31956-03.html",
   "quest": 418,
   "text": "Warehouse Keeper Rydie: Well, the stories? They are all kinds of passwords for the test. Some are stories about a hard mission, considering the question and coming up with an answer. Don't worry, it probably won't fail this test. Keep this in mind! You and I, we're both Dwarves.",
   "header": "Warehouse Keeper Rydie",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"I've got it.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00418_PathOfTheArtisan 31956-04.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00418_PathOfTheArtisan",
     "event": "31956-04.html",
     "quest": 418,
     "to": "Q00418_PathOfTheArtisan/31956-04.html",
     "effect": "reward"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00418_PathOfTheArtisan/31956-04.html": {
   "file": "Q00418_PathOfTheArtisan/31956-04.html",
   "quest": 418,
   "text": "Warehouse Keeper Rydel: Good, then take this certificate. You've passed the Path to an Artisan! Go see Head Blacksmith Tapoy in Gludin Village and he'll make you an Artisan. Good luck!",
   "header": "Warehouse Keeper Rydel",
   "sets": {
    "reward": true
   },
   "outcome": "reward",
   "links": []
  },
